      "spec": "HOCON.md#unchanged-from-json",
      "rule": "the number 2^63 written as a float must keep its value; typesafe/config 1.4.9 renders it as 9223372036854775807 (clamped to Long.MAX_VALUE, lightbend ConfigValueTest, lightbend/config#873), main renders 9.223372036854776E18, which is the same value",
      "expected": {
